    23→ * - Three sizes: small (24px), medium (40px), large (60px)
    24→ * - Lottie animation support with fallback to native ActivityIndicator
    25→ * - Optional loading text with proper styling
    26→ * - Android-specific optimizations for Lottie animations
    27→ *
    28→ * @example
